{"slug":"longest-repeated-piece","title":"The Longest Piece That Appears Twice Without Overlap","topic":"dp","difficulty":"medium","order":756,"tags":["dp","string","repeated-substring"],"timeLimitMs":2000,"concept":{"title":"Compare the word with itself: a common suffix of two prefixes, cut off at the distance between them","body":["Find the length of the **longest substring that occurs at least twice** in the word, where the two occurrences must **not overlap** (they may touch). For `banana` it is 1 (`a`, or `n`: the piece `ana` occurs twice but the two occurrences share the middle `a`), for `abcabc` it is 3, and for `aaaa` it is 2 (`aa` twice).","This is the \"longest common substring\" table of the word with itself. Let `rep(i, j)` (with `i < j`) be the length of the longest piece that **ends at the position `i` and also at the position `j`**. If the letters `s[i]` and `s[j]` differ it is 0. If they are equal, the piece is one letter longer than the piece ending at `i - 1` and `j - 1`: `rep(i - 1, j - 1) + 1`. But the two occurrences must not overlap, and the earlier one ends at `i` while the later one starts at `j - length + 1`, so the length may not exceed the distance `j - i`: **`rep(i, j) = min(rep(i - 1, j - 1) + 1, j - i)`** when the letters are equal. The answer is the largest `rep`.",{"code":"prev = [0] * (n + 1)\nbest = 0\nfor j in range(2, n + 1):                    # j and i are counted from 1\n    cur = [0] * (n + 1)\n    for i in range(1, j):\n        if s[i - 1] == s[j - 1]:\n            cur[i] = min(prev[i - 1] + 1, j - i)\n            best = max(best, cur[i])\n    prev = cur\nprint(best)"},"The cap `j - i` is applied at every step, and it is correct to cap the previous value as well: `prev[i - 1]` was capped by the smaller distance `(j - 1) - (i - 1) = j - i`, which is the same limit. Half of the table (`i < j`) is used, about a million cells for a word of 1500 letters. Keep only the previous row: O(n) memory."]},"statement":["A word `s` is given. Print the length of the longest string that occurs in `s` at two different places that do not overlap (the second occurrence starts after the first one ends). If no letter occurs twice, print 0."],"inputFormat":["One line with the word `s`."],"outputFormat":["Print the length of the longest non-overlapping repeated piece."],"constraints":["2 <= length of s <= 1500","The word consists of lowercase English letters."],"examples":[{"input":"abcabc\n","output":"3\n","note":"The piece abc occurs twice: 3."},{"input":"aaaa\n","output":"2\n","note":"The piece aa occurs twice, side by side: 2."}],"hints":["Compare the word with itself: rep(i, j) is the length of the common piece ending at i and at j.","For equal letters rep(i, j) = rep(i - 1, j - 1) + 1, but at most j - i so that the pieces do not overlap.","The answer is the largest rep; two rows are enough."],"starter":{"python":"import sys\ninput = sys.stdin.readline\n\ns = input().strip()\n\n# Your code here\n","cpp":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    string s;\n    cin >> s;\n\n    // Your code here\n\n    return 0;\n}\n","java":"import java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer tokens = new StringTokenizer(\"\");\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (!tokens.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            tokens = new StringTokenizer(in.readLine());\n        }\n        return tokens.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        String s = next();\n\n        // Your code here\n    }\n}\n"},"solution":{"explanation":["rep(i, j) is the length of the longest common piece ending at i and at j (i < j): 0 for different letters and min(rep(i - 1, j - 1) + 1, j - i) for equal letters, so that the two occurrences do not overlap. The answer is the largest value; two rows are kept."],"complexity":"Time O(n^2), space O(n).","code":{"python":"import sys\ninput = sys.stdin.readline\n\ns = input().strip()\n\nn = len(s)\nprev = [0] * (n + 1)\nbest = 0\nfor j in range(2, n + 1):\n    cur = [0] * (n + 1)\n    sj = s[j - 1]\n    for i in range(1, j):\n        if s[i - 1] == sj:\n            v = prev[i - 1] + 1\n            if v > j - i:\n                v = j - i\n            cur[i] = v\n            if v > best:\n                best = v\n    prev = cur\nprint(best)\n","cpp":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    string s;\n    cin >> s;\n\n    int n = (int)s.size();\n    vector<int> prev(n + 1, 0), cur(n + 1, 0);\n    int best = 0;\n    for (int j = 2; j <= n; j++) {\n        fill(cur.begin(), cur.end(), 0);\n        for (int i = 1; i < j; i++) {\n            if (s[i - 1] == s[j - 1]) {\n                cur[i] = min(prev[i - 1] + 1, j - i);\n                best = max(best, cur[i]);\n            }\n        }\n        swap(prev, cur);\n    }\n    cout << best << \"\\n\";\n\n    return 0;\n}\n","java":"import java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer tokens = new StringTokenizer(\"\");\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (!tokens.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            tokens = new StringTokenizer(in.readLine());\n        }\n        return tokens.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        String s = next();\n\n        int n = s.length();\n        int[] prev = new int[n + 1];\n        int[] cur = new int[n + 1];\n        int best = 0;\n        for (int j = 2; j <= n; j++) {\n            Arrays.fill(cur, 0);\n            for (int i = 1; i < j; i++) {\n                if (s.charAt(i - 1) == s.charAt(j - 1)) {\n                    cur[i] = Math.min(prev[i - 1] + 1, j - i);\n                    best = Math.max(best, cur[i]);\n                }\n            }\n            int[] swap = prev;\n            prev = cur;\n            cur = swap;\n        }\n        System.out.println(best);\n    }\n}\n"}},"tests":[{"input":"abcabc\n","output":"3\n"},{"input":"aaaa\n","output":"2\n"},{"input":"banana\n","output":"2\n"},{"input":"ab\n","output":"0\n"},{"input":"aa\n","output":"1\n"},{"input":"abcdef\n","output":"0\n"},{"input":"babbbbbbbabbaabbabaa\n","output":"4\n"},{"input":"aaaabbcbbbabaaaacbaabaccbbccbccacabbaaacbacabcaccabcccaababaacbabcbaccacbcccbabaccccbaaabbbcaaacbabb\n","output":"6\n"},{"input":"\n","output":"8\n"},{"input":"\n","output":"20\n"},{"input":"\n","output":"4\n"},{"input":"\n","output":"19\n"},{"input":"\n","output":"13\n"},{"input":"\n","output":"749\n"},{"input":"\n","output":"750\n"},{"input":"\n","output":"750\n"},{"input":"\n","output":"600\n"},{"input":"\n","output":"7\n"},{"input":"\n","output":"728\n"}]}